  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BaseOASIS v2.0.4\n\nConnects the OASIS to Base -- the Coinbase-incubated OP Stack L2, part of the Ethereum Superchain, with EVM equivalence, sub-cent fees, and Coinbase ecosystem integration. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and NFTs. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.3\n- feat: complete Edge offline runtime and release automation (279c090)\n- fix(BaseOASIS): sign sends with the avatar's Base wallet, never derive addresses from keys (98b5025)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BaseOASIS",
